<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MAKE A LITTLE PLAN</view><view class="title">把下一次相遇，<br/>排进日历。</view><block wx:if="{{success}}"><view class="notice">询单已收到。Hannah 会联系你确认方案、档期和定金；当前尚未锁定拍摄时间。</view><view class="token" selectable>{{token}}</view><button class="button" bindtap="copy">复制私人查询码</button><button class="chip space" bindtap="requests">查看我的询单</button><text class="small-link" bindtap="again">计划另一次拍摄</text><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view></block><block wx:else><view class="label">拍摄类型</view><picker range="{{sessions}}" range-key="name" value="{{sessionIndex}}" bindchange="chooseSession"><view class="picker">{{sessions[sessionIndex].name}} ↓</view></picker><view class="label">套餐</view><picker range="{{packageLabels}}" value="{{packageIndex}}" bindchange="choosePackage"><view class="picker">{{packageLabels[packageIndex]}} ↓</view></picker><view class="card"><view class="price">{{selectedPackage.from?'起价 ':''}}A${{price}}</view><view class="muted" wx:for="{{selectedPackage.zhDetails}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</view><view class="row space"><text>加拍真实胶片 + A$100</text><switch checked="{{film}}" bindchange="film" color="#3b4832"/></view><view class="muted">一卷含冲洗。路费、加片与其他选项另议；以 Hannah 确认的报价为准。</view></view><view class="label">喜欢的风格</view><picker range="{{styleNames}}" value="{{styleIndex}}" bindchange="chooseStyle"><view class="picker">{{styleNames[styleIndex]}} ↓</view></picker><view class="heading">可询问的档期</view><picker mode="date" fields="month" value="{{month}}" bindchange="month"><view class="picker">{{month}} · 切换月份 ↓</view></picker><view class="muted space">以下均为 Brisbane 时间（AEST，UTC+10），比北京时间快两小时。发起询单不代表预订成功。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="notice">正在查看档期…</view><view wx:elif="{{calendarError}}" class="notice error">{{calendarError}}<button class="chip" bindtap="loadDates">重试</button></view><view wx:elif="{{!slots.length}}" class="notice">本月暂无公开时段，不一定代表约满。请在下方填写你希望的日期。</view><button class="chip space {{slotId===item.id?'active':''}}" wx:for="{{slots}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-label="{{item.label}}" bindtap="selectSlot">{{item.label}}</button><view wx:if="{{slotId}}" class="notice">已选：{{slotLabel}}<text class="small-link" bindtap="clearSlot">取消所选时段</text></view><view class="label">偏好的日期 / 灵活程度</view><input value="{{preferredDates}}" data-field="preferredDates" bindinput="field" maxlength="500" placeholder="例如周末下午，或具体日期"/><view class="label">姓名 *</view><input value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="field" maxlength="100"/><view class="label">微信号 *</view><input value="{{wechat}}" data-field="wechat" bindinput="field" maxlength="100"/><view class="label">邮箱（选填）</view><input value="{{email}}" data-field="email" bindinput="field" maxlength="254"/><view class="label">地点（选填）</view><input value="{{location}}" data-field="location" bindinput="field" maxlength="250"/><view class="label">想法 / 妆造 / 场景需求</view><textarea value="{{message}}" data-field="message" bindinput="field" maxlength="4000" placeholder="一起告诉我，就不用重复沟通啦。"/><checkbox-group bindchange="consent" class="space"><label><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{consent}}" color="#3b4832"/>我同意工作室使用这些信息回复询单、管理预约，并在此设备保存草稿及私人查询码。</label></checkbox-group><text class="small-link" bindtap="guide">阅读拍摄须知与隐私说明</text><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><button class="button" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{sending}}" loading="{{sending}}">{{sending?'正在提交…':'发送我的拍摄计划 ↗'}}</button><view class="muted space">小程序不收取付款。Hannah 确认方案及定金后才会保留档期。</view></block></view>
